    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ă<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 3896,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002010200070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "J’ai autre chose à faire.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 3908,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004A201900610069002000610075007400720065002000630068006F00730065002000E0002000660061006900720065002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Il me semble t’avoir dit que j’avais besoin\nd’un Pokémon de type Sol...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 3960,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 76
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Oh ! Un <U+0010><U+0002>ā<U+0008> !\nSon rôle dans l’histoire s’écrit tout seul !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 4112,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004F00680020002100200055006E0020001000020101000800200021000A0053006F006E0020007200F4006C0065002000640061006E00730020006C20190068006900730074006F00690072006500200073201900E9006300720069007400200074006F007500740020007300650075006C0020002100100002011401B50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 64
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Au suivant !\nLequel connaît Lance-Flammes ?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 4240,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00410075002000730075006900760061006E007400200021000A004C0065007100750065006C00200063006F006E006E006100EE00740020004C0061006E00630065002D0046006C0061006D006D006500730020003F00100002011401B50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 48
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Non, j’ai besoin que tu me montres un Pokémon\nqui connaît Lance-Flammes !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 4336,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 78
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Un <U+0010><U+0002>ā\t... Mais bien sûr !\nLe décor se dessine dans ma tête !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 35,
      "offsetInSection": 4492,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0055006E00200010000201010009002E002E002E0020004D0061006900730020006200690065006E0020007300FB007200200021000A004C00650020006400E90063006F0072002000730065002000640065007300730069006E0065002000640061006E00730020006D00610020007400EA007400650020002100100002011401B50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 66
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Et pour couronner le tout, le troisième Pokémon !\nLequel porte une Méga-Gemme ?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 36,
      "offsetInSection": 4624,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 84
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ah non, ça ne va pas ! Choisis celui\nqui porte une Méga-Gemme !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 37,
      "offsetInSection": 4792,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004100680020006E006F006E002C002000E700610020006E0065002000760061002000700061007300200021002000430068006F0069007300690073002000630065006C00750069000A00710075006900200070006F00720074006500200075006E00650020004D00E900670061002D00470065006D006D00650020002100100002011401B50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 68
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Un <U+0010><U+0002>ā\n ? Oh, je me vois déjà\nremporter tous les prix littéraires !<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nMerci de m’avoir montré ces Pokémon,\nj’ai retrouvé l’inspiration grâce à eux !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 38,
      "offsetInSection": 4928,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 154
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Après ce que tu as fait pour moi, c’est la moindre\ndes choses que je te dévoile sur quoi je travaille !<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nIl s’agit d’un roman d’aventures, et il commence\nainsi...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 39,
      "offsetInSection": 5236,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 169
    },
    {
      "displayText": "« Depuis le fin fond de la nature sauvage de Kalos\ns’élève un cri vigoureux...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 40,
      "offsetInSection": 5576,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 83
    },
    {
      "displayText": "C’est <U+0010><U+0002>Ă<U+0002> !<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nLe jour se lève dans la magnifique forêt qui l’a vu\nnaître, et il vient de prendre une grande décision :<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nlui aussi, il va méga-évoluer !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 9,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 41,
      "offsetInSection": 5744,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 160
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Il part donc à la recherche d’une Méga-Gemme\naux côtés <U+0010><U+0003>ᐈ<U+0000><U+0001><U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nChaque étape de leur périple les rapproche\nde leur objectif : la Tour Maîtrise...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 11,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 42,
      "offsetInSection": 6064,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 155
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Mais soudain, <U+0010><U+0002>Ă<U+0004>, tenant une\nMéga-Gemme, se dresse en travers de leur route !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 43,
      "offsetInSection": 6376,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 84
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Il les défie en combat singulier, leur promettant\nsa précieuse pierre s’ils venaient à le surpasser.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 44,
      "offsetInSection": 6544,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 105
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ă<U+0002> accepte les termes du combat\net envoie son champion : <U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000> !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 45,
      "offsetInSection": 6756,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0010000201020002002000610063006300650070007400650020006C006500730020007400650072006D0065007300200064007500200063006F006D006200610074000A0065007400200065006E0076006F0069006500200073006F006E0020006300680061006D00700069006F006E0020003A002000100002010000000020002100100002011401B50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 70
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Mais c’était sans compter sur <U+0010><U+0002>Ă<U+0003>,\nqui, pour voler la Méga-Gemme, surgit et<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nembrase la scène avec Lance-Flammes !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 7,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 46,
      "offsetInSection": 6896,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 122
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000> bondit devant <U+0010><U+0002>Ă<U+0002>\npour encaisser l’attaque à sa place...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 47,
      "offsetInSection": 7140,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "001000020100000000200062006F006E00640069007400200064006500760061006E007400200010000201020002000A0070006F0075007200200065006E00630061006900730073006500720020006C20190061007400740061007100750065002000E000200073006100200070006C006100630065002E002E002E00100002011401B50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 67
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>봆<U+0000>... et il repousse <U+0010><U+0002>Ă<U+0003> et\n<U+0010><U+0002>Ă<U+0004><U+0010><U+0001>븀\nau fin fond<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nde l’Antre Néréen !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 15,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 48,
      "offsetInSection": 7276,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 78
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ƌ<U+0001>, gardien<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿ<U+0002>ne de la Méga-Évolution,\na assisté à la scène...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 49,
      "offsetInSection": 7432,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002018B0001002C0020006700610072006400690065006E00100003110000FF0002006E00650020006400650020006C00610020004D00E900670061002D00C90076006F006C007500740069006F006E002C000A0061002000610073007300690073007400E9002000E00020006C006100200073006300E8006E0065002E002E002E00100002011401B50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 71
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Reconnaissant la puissance <U+0010><U+0003>ᐈ<U+0000><U+0001><U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>,\n<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿȄelleil lui permet de méga-évoluer !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 11,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 50,
      "offsetInSection": 7576,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 83
    },
    {
      "displayText": "C’est le premier être humain méga-évolué !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 51,
      "offsetInSection": 7744,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004320190065007300740020006C00650020007000720065006D006900650072002000EA007400720065002000680075006D00610069006E0020006D00E900670061002D00E90076006F006C007500E90020002100100002011401B50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 47
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ă<U+0002> n’a pas raté une seule seconde\nde ce spectacle et, plus résolu que jamais...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 52,
      "offsetInSection": 7840,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 86
    },
    {
      "displayText": "... il continue son périple à la recherche\nd’une Méga-Gemme portant son nom ! »<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 53,
      "offsetInSection": 8012,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 84
    },
    {
      "displayText": "N’était-ce pas incroyable ?\nAh, quel conteur de génie je fais !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 54,
      "offsetInSection": 8180,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004E201900E90074006100690074002D00630065002000700061007300200069006E00630072006F007900610062006C00650020003F000A00410068002C0020007100750065006C00200063006F006E00740065007500720020006400650020006700E9006E006900650020006A0065002000660061006900730020002100100002011401B50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 68
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ah, oui ! Absolument ! Tout à fait !",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 55,
      "offsetInSection": 8316,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00410068002C0020006F00750069002000210020004100620073006F006C0075006D0065006E00740020002100200054006F00750074002000E000200066006100690074002000210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 37
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Oui, oui, bien sûr, incroyable, formidable...",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 56,
      "offsetInSection": 8392,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004F00750069002C0020006F00750069002C0020006200690065006E0020007300FB0072002C00200069006E00630072006F007900610062006C0065002C00200066006F0072006D0069006400610062006C0065002E002E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 46
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Je vais me remettre à l’ouvrage et présenter\nmon travail aux Éditions d’Illumis !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 57,
      "offsetInSection": 8484,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 86
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Je te dois tout ! Je compte sur toi pour continuer\nà m’aider quand j’aurai trouvé le succès !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 58,
      "offsetInSection": 8656,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
